         # wheel. A ship or part that is still up is left where it is; only the owner steps run.
+        # family server (11-21): Astron's database state server gives no answer at all to "is it up?" while the object
+        # is still loading (DBStateServer::handle_get_activated returns early). A ship bought while his other ships
+        # were activating asked at that moment, its job waited for good, and every later ship job for that pirate
+        # with it: no ship came to his dock and the shipwright said busy until a restart. Ask again until an answer
